,"isbn_13":"9789022593509","isbn_10":null,"title":"De genezer van Zalindov","language":"dut","publisher":"Boekerij","id":987242005,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":null}},{"ref":"d4","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w4","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w4","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a4","text":"Kiva werkt als genezer in de gevangenis Zalindov, waar ze zelf al jaren vastzit. Wanneer een ernstig zieke rebellenkoningin wordt binnengebracht, krijgt zij de opdracht haar in leven te houden. De vrouw moet gevaarlijke beproevingen doorstaan die zij in deze toestand niet aankan. Een geheim bericht van Kiva''s familie verandert de betekenis van haar taak. Kiva besluit zelf de proeven te ondergaan. Daarmee zet ze haar leven op het spel voor een kans op vrijheid.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL22011552W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432477020"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-043.json#119","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"ThePrisonHealer2021=DeGenezerVanZalindov9789022593509, confirmed DutchHardcover despite originalEnglishsource. No wholetrilogy/omnibus inference."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL22011552W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p432477020"],"review":"content-review-009.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL60026924M","isbn13":"9789022593509","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"Exact bound bulk-archive attempt retained. No verified asset imported. Existing resolver may load a correct front hosted; otherwise r