tion":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-043"}},{"ref":"w6","relation":"works","key":{"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL31299169W"},"before":null,"after":{"title":"Trial of the Sun Queen","author_id":"@a6","first_publish_year":2022,"open_library_id":"OL31299169W","cover_id":null,"source_type":"open_library","work_type":"novel","native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL31299169W","id":987142007}},{"ref":"e6","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL60468823M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w6","open_library_edition_id":"OL60468823M","isbn_13":"9789026171956","isbn_10":null,"title":"Trial of the Sun Queen","language":"dut","publisher":"Uitgeverij De Fontein","id":987242007,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":null}},{"ref":"d6","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w6","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w6","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a6","text":"Na twaalf jaar gevangenschap wordt Lor onverwacht vrijgelaten. Ze belandt aan het hof van de Zonnekoning, waar tien vrouwen strijden om zijn toekomstige koningin te worden. Voor Lor zou een overwinning vrijheid betekenen, maar ze begrijpt niet waarom juist zij is toegelaten. De andere kandidaten beschouwen haar als een indringer. Terwijl ze probeert te overleven, blijft de dreiging bestaan dat ze naar haar vroegere heerser wordt teruggestuurd. De wedstrijd vraagt daardoor meer dan het winnen van koninklijke aandacht.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL31299169W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p440452449"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-043.json#121","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:06:11