,"publisher":"Van Goor","id":987242008,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":null}},{"ref":"d7","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w7","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w7","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a7","text":"Schoonspringster Scarlett richt zich op haar studie en haar herstel na een zware blessure. Zwemmer Lukas houdt zijn leven juist strak onder controle om op het hoogste niveau te presteren. Wanneer ze een persoonlijk geheim delen, ontstaat een afspraak die eenvoudig en tijdelijk zou moeten blijven. De druk van hun sportloopbanen neemt echter toe, terwijl hun onderlinge band verandert. Scarlett moet bepalen hoeveel ruimte ze kan geven aan gevoelens die niet passen binnen het plan dat ze voor zichzelf had gemaakt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42413995W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444256032"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-043.json#123","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"DeepEnd2025 sportsromance, exact DutchPaperback9789000397013, original and Dutch printretain title. Do not inferlanguage fromEnglishname."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42413995W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444256032"],"review":"content-review-010.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL60076093M","isbn13":"9789000397013","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"Exact bound bulk-archive attempt retained. No verified asset imported. Existing resolver may load a correct front hosted; otherwise record neutral placeholder separately. Not a claim 