6126M","isbn_13":"9789034700315","isbn_10":null,"title":"Een pleidooi voor haar liefde","language":"dut","publisher":"Harlequin Holland","id":987242010,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":null}},{"ref":"d9","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w9","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w9","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a9","text":"Danni wil haar plaats veroveren in de autoracesport, waar mannen de dienst uitmaken. Haar plannen raken verstrengeld met haar gevoelens voor Shiloh O''Rourke. Wanneer ze ontdekt dat hij betrokken was bij het ongeluk dat haar broer het leven kostte, verandert haar liefde in woede. Ze wil hem verantwoordelijk houden, maar haar gevoelens verdwijnen daarmee niet vanzelf. Danni moet haar verlangen naar vergelding zien te verenigen met de band die juist met hem is ontstaan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL8032333W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p831297069"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-043.json#125","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"RaceForRevenge1982=EenPleidooiVoorHaarLiefde1983DutchPaperback9789034700315; exactLynseyStevens translation, not an omnibus."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL8032333W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p831297069"],"review":"content-review-010.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL33146126M","isbn13":"9789034700315","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"Exact bound bulk-archive attempt retained. No verified asset imported. Existing resolver may load a correct front hosted; otherw