ulp als fotograaf werken, maar zij draagt zijn apparatuur nog met zich mee. Het huis van de oude kunstenaar en de verhalen over hem brengen haar aan het twijfelen over wat zij ziet. Hermans verbindt haar opdracht met vragen over waarneming, roem en de grens tussen bewondering en goedgelovigheid.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.debezigebij.nl/boek/geyersteins-dynamiek/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822217023"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-043.json#185","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"GeyersteinDynamiek1982standalone DutchHardcover9789023408024; contemporaryscholarlyreview and publishercontent agree; latercollectionnot selected."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.debezigebij.nl/boek/geyersteins-dynamiek/","https://www.dbnl.org/tekst/_voo013198201_01/_voo013198201_01_0006.php","https://www.wfhermansvolledigewerken.nl/?delen=deel-8","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15250250W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p822217023"],"review":"content-amendment-020.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL3117808M","isbn13":"9789023408024","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:06:11.626Z","note":"Exact bound bulk-archive attempt retained. No verified asset imported. Existing resolver may load a correct front hosted; otherwise record neutral placeholder separately. Not a claim that this edition has no cover.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":6275803,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"limitation":"No verified image is impo